   "text": "Staff picks on Instagram, events on a chalkboard. Neither is on your own site.\n\nWhat an independent bookstore website needs:\n1. Staff picks with a voice\n2. Events on your own page\n3. Newsletter signup near the top\n4. Easy to read on the way to you\n\n📌 Send this to someone who runs a small business.\n\nTry it with one sentence: free preview, no sign-up, about 30 seconds. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#indiebookstore #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
