   "text": "A website prompt for a ceramic artist. Copy it and change the details:\n\n\"Ceramics studio in Porto. Warm, handmade, clay and off-white. Monthly drops of twelve pieces, glazed with local seaweed ash. Current drop, next drop date, studio story, contact.\"\n\nWho and where, the mood, what's different, what to show. Write it in your own language: the copy follows it.\n\n📌 Save this for later.\n\nFree preview, no sign-up, about 30 seconds. You only pay if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#ceramics #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
